:: StoryInit
/%
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
STORYINIT - MINIMAL STATE TEMPLATE
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
This initializes the player's state for the minimal skeleton.
Only essential stats and resources - no inventory, quests, or complex systems.
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%/

/* Character stats */
<<set $time = {minute:0, hour:20, date:7, day:3, days:0, month:5, year:2020}>>
<<set $stats = {
        str: 5,
        dex: 5,
        con: 5
}>>

/* Resources - consumable currencies */
<<set $resources = {
        stamina: 100,
        maxStamina: 100,
        stress: 0,
        maxStress: 100,
        hunger: 0,
        maxHunger: 100,
        money: 50,
        willpower:0,
        axWillpower:10
}>>

/* Simple flags for story progress */
<<set $flags = {}>>

/* Preload all scene images + NPC portraits so first-visit navigation
 * doesn't flash. The asset set is small (pixel art), so loading
 * everything upfront is cheap. Add new scene paths here as you create
 * them. */
<<run setup.preload.all([
        "assets/campus.png",
        "assets/library.png",
        "assets/cafeteria.png",
        "assets/study.png",
        "assets/front_desk.png"
])>>

